Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.63,0:00:10.27,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}For the second time in his career,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N职业生涯第二次
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.27,0:00:17.41,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Alejandro Davidovich Fokina is into the final of a Masters 1000.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N福基纳打进了大师赛决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.60,0:00:24.82,TL,,0,0,0,,他职业生涯的前{\fs78}5{\fs68}次决赛 全是亚军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.82,0:00:27.91,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}5{\fs68}个冠军点 一个都没握住
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.20,0:00:31.19,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2017{\fs68}年
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.19,0:00:33.90,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}18{\fs68}岁的他拿下温网青少年冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.90,0:00:35.12,TL,,0,0,0,,一盘没丢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.12,0:00:38.36,TL,,0,0,0,,那一年 他青少年组{\fs78}20{\fs68}胜{\fs78}1{\fs68}负
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.29,0:00:45.25,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I started with my father in the beach, in the sand courts in my city,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我是跟着爸爸在海边开始的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.25,0:00:50.47,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and it was my father who pushed me to play tennis.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N是爸爸推着我去打网球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.90,0:00:53.46,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2022{\fs68}年{\fs78}4{\fs68}月 蒙特卡洛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.46,0:00:56.13,TL,,0,0,0,,第二轮 他碰上了世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.30,0:00:59.43,TL,,0,0,0,,他破了德约科维奇{\fs78}9{\fs68}个发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.43,0:01:01.55,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}3{\fs68}盘赢下世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.47,0:01:13.99,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}There it is, it is a day Alejandro Davidovich Fokina will remember for a very, very long time.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一天 福基纳会记很久很久
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.07,0:01:18.63,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Only his second top 10 win, this time it's over the world number one.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N生涯第二场赢前十 赢的是世界第一
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.10,0:01:21.34,TL,,0,0,0,,一周后 他打进生涯第一个决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.34,0:01:24.12,TL,,0,0,0,,对手是卫冕冠军西西帕斯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.49,0:01:28.73,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's just wide.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N出界了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.73,0:01:36.95,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And it is mission accomplished in Monte Carlo for Stefanos Tsitsipas.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N西西帕斯在蒙特卡洛完成了卫冕
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.91,0:01:41.91,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Alejandro, first but not last,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N亚历杭德罗 第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.91,0:01:43.27,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I'm pretty sure about it.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但肯定不是最后一次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.27,0:01:47.71,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And I would like to tell you congratulations.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我想跟你说声恭喜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.20,0:01:50.99,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2025{\fs68}年 他又打进{\fs78}4{\fs68}次决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.99,0:01:53.57,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2{\fs68}月的德尔雷海滩 决胜盘{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.57,0:01:56.41,TL,,0,0,0,,对手发球 他握到两个冠军点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.09,0:02:09.49,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Yeah!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N漂亮！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.81,0:02:19.55,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, has he made it?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他拿下了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.63,0:02:31.45,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}After match point heartache in one of his previous finals,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他在之前一次决赛里痛失赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.87,0:02:34.63,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}this time he saves a couple of match points.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一次 他救下了两个赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.77,0:02:41.01,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's heartbreak again for Alejandro Davidovich Fokina.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N福基纳又一次心碎了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.70,0:02:44.00,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}7{\fs68}月的华盛顿 决胜盘{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.00,0:02:46.72,TL,,0,0,0,,他发球胜赛 {\fs78}30{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68}领先
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.17,0:02:51.47,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, nervy game from 30-love up,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N三十比零领先 却打得发紧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.47,0:02:52.75,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}mis-hit forehands.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N正手连连打飞
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.51,0:02:56.83,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh my gosh!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N天哪！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.81,0:03:01.77,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Unbelievably fortunate from De Minaur,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N德米纳尔运气太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.77,0:03:03.53,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}acknowledges it, but what a time.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他也承认 偏偏是这个时候
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.67,0:03:06.49,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Please, players are ready.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N请 球员已准备
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.85,0:03:09.37,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Two hours and 39 minutes on the clock.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N比赛已经打了两小时三十九分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.80,0:03:11.09,TL,,0,0,0,,那一局打了{\fs78}10{\fs68}分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.09,0:03:13.06,TL,,0,0,0,,对手连救{\fs78}3{\fs68}个冠军点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.06,0:03:15.30,TL,,0,0,0,,最后一个 德米纳尔放了一个高球
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.30,0:03:18.90,TL,,0,0,0,,擦着边线落地 离出界只差{\fs78}16{\fs68}毫米
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.97,0:03:29.53,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And that is superb from the Australian, just superb.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这位澳大利亚人打得太漂亮了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.43,0:03:34.69,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's the other way for Alejandro Davidovich Fokina.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N福基纳那边 是另一番滋味
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.87,0:03:38.03,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}How will he recover from another setback?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N又一次挫折 他要怎么走出来？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.59,0:03:45.31,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Well, it's the biggest title of Joao Fonseca's very young career so far.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这是丰塞卡年轻生涯里最大的冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.31,0:03:50.65,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}As he wins the 500 level event here in Basel.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他拿下了巴塞尔的五百赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.00,0:03:53.20,TL,,0,0,0,,第五个决赛 又是亚军
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.20,0:03:54.09,TL,,0,0,0,,那年秋天
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.09,0:03:56.35,TL,,0,0,0,,他升到生涯最高的世界第{\fs78}14{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.35,0:03:58.66,TL,,0,0,0,,却一个冠军都还没有
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.20,0:04:04.33,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2026{\fs68}年{\fs78}5{\fs68}月 法网 打完首轮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.33,0:04:06.33,TL,,0,0,0,,教练和他一起吃了晚饭
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.33,0:04:08.79,TL,,0,0,0,,几个小时后 教练发来一条短信
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.79,0:04:11.81,TL,,0,0,0,,不干了 他说 教练飞去了迈阿密
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.81,0:04:14.16,TL,,0,0,0,,还拉黑了他和妻子的电话
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.60,0:04:17.16,TL,,0,0,0,,一个月后 马略卡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.16,0:04:19.51,TL,,0,0,0,,家门口 第六个决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.39,0:04:27.43,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Mission finally accomplished for Alejandro Davidovich Fokina.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N福基纳终于做到了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.77,0:04:33.27,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He's a champion on the ATP tour for the very first time.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他第一次拿到巡回赛冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.31,0:04:37.45,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And he does it on Spanish soil in Mallorca.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N就在西班牙的马略卡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.33,0:04:41.29,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a moment.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N多美的时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.11,0:04:44.47,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's been a long time coming.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一天等了很久
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.79,0:04:46.09,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}you have to say that.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N不得不说
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.09,0:04:50.01,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And the disappointments of finals past{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N过去那些决赛的失落
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.01,0:04:54.93,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}washed away in a wave of emotion.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N在这一刻全被冲走了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.60,0:04:57.40,TL,,0,0,0,,一周后的温网第四轮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.40,0:04:59.74,TL,,0,0,0,,他和阿利亚西姆打满{\fs78}5{\fs68}盘
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.74,0:05:02.15,TL,,0,0,0,,第四盘 对手{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}发球胜赛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.15,0:05:04.91,TL,,0,0,0,,他扭伤脚踝 叫了医疗暂停
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.35,0:05:13.35,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Finally he takes it. And there is the release of the emotion.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N终于拿下了 情绪一下子释放出来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.45,0:05:21.65,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Two prize fighters at the end of 12 rounds.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N像两个打满十二回合的拳手
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.00,0:05:26.63,TL,,0,0,0,,输球之后 两人在网前吵了起来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.63,0:05:28.36,TL,,0,0,0,,紧接着 是背伤
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.36,0:05:29.73,TL,,0,0,0,,北美的硬地赛季
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.73,0:05:32.62,TL,,0,0,0,,他全部缺席 美网也退了赛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.80,0:05:36.96,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}9{\fs68}月 他在成都复出
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.96,0:05:37.83,TL,,0,0,0,,成都决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.83,0:05:40.53,TL,,0,0,0,,他一个破发点都没给胡尔卡奇
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.53,0:05:43.13,TL,,0,0,0,,抢七{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}落后 最后{\fs78}7{\fs68}个小分
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.13,0:05:44.64,TL,,0,0,0,,他拿了{\fs78}6{\fs68}个
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.87,0:05:47.75,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}But the smile says it all.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N笑容说明了一切
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.89,0:05:52.43,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}After losing his first five tour level finals,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N头五次决赛全输之后
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.93,0:05:54.87,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}he's now won two in a row.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他现在连赢了两个
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.81,0:05:58.51,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And this one came having not played a match{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N而这一个冠军之前
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.51,0:06:00.13,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}for two and a half months.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他两个半月没打比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.60,0:06:02.23,TL,,0,0,0,,然后 是上海
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.23,0:06:03.48,TL,,0,0,0,,第三轮对蒂亚福
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.48,0:06:05.35,TL,,0,0,0,,他救下了一个赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.00,0:06:09.35,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜盘 又是抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.11,0:06:19.07,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, he's done it!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他做到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.43,0:06:22.79,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a victory that is!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N多么漂亮的胜利！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.40,0:06:25.62,TL,,0,0,0,,第四轮对胡尔卡奇 先丢一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.62,0:06:28.06,TL,,0,0,0,,又一次打进决胜盘抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.37,0:06:36.15,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, what an incredible finish!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N多么精彩的收尾！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.90,0:06:40.19,TL,,0,0,0,,半决赛对兹维列夫 他也先丢一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.17,0:06:53.25,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}For the second time in his career, Alejandro Davidovich Fokina is into the final of a Masters 1000.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N生涯第二次 打进大师赛决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.75,0:07:04.75,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And for the second time in his career, he gets the better of Alexander Zverev.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N也是生涯第二次赢下兹维列夫
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.57,0:07:08.15,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}At the end, it's not easy when you're out.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N离开赛场的日子不好过
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.47,0:07:11.37,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}So you have a lot of time to think.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N你会有很多时间去想
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.91,0:07:16.09,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}For me, I think before I was not enjoying, I was very frustrated,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N以前我并不享受 总是很沮丧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.83,0:07:21.05,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and this kind of time gave me a lot of thinking,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这段时间让我想了很多
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.31,0:07:23.99,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}to see what I want to do with my future.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N想清楚了未来要做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.40,0:07:25.78,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}18{\fs68}号的决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.78,0:07:27.74,TL,,0,0,0,,对手是{\fs78}20{\fs68}岁的霍达尔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.74,0:07:29.15,TL,,0,0,0,,两人从没交过手
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.15,0:07:31.22,TL,,0,0,0,,两个西班牙人会师上海
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.22,0:07:33.13,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}4{\fs68}年前 西西帕斯对他说
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.13,0:07:35.46,TL,,0,0,0,,第一次 但不会是最后一次
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.46,0:07:37.17,TL,,0,0,0,,这是他第八个决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.17,0:07:39.61,TL,,0,0,0,,输过{\fs78}5{\fs68}次的人 你觉得这一次
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.61,0:07:41.23,TL,,0,0,0,,他握得住吗？
